<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-050" chapter-id="c-liangshu-050-xiezao" source-id="s-liangshu-050-xiezao-ws1514482">
  <p id="c-liangshu-050-xiezao:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">兄<persName id="c-liangshu-050-xiezao:p001:m0001" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAA">才卿</persName>早卒，其子<persName id="c-liangshu-050-xiezao:p001:m0008" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAAA">藻</persName>幼孤，<persName id="c-liangshu-050-xiezao:p001:m0012" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAB">幾卿</persName>撫養甚至。及<persName id="c-liangshu-050-xiezao:p001:m0020" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAAA">藻</persName>成立，歷清官公府祭酒、主簿，皆<persName id="c-liangshu-050-xiezao:p001:m0036" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CDAABAB">幾卿</persName>獎訓之力也。<rs id="c-liangshu-050-xiezao:p001:m0044" type="unresolved">世</rs>以此稱之。</p>
</text>
